#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_api_mode__production
msgid "Production / Live"
msgstr "Producción / En vivo"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_api_mode
msgid ""
"Controls whether the 'test' flag is sent to the ViaBill API. Use "
"'Test' while developing or testing (even when Odoo is in "
"Enabled/Production state). Switch to 'Production / Live' only when you "
"are ready to process real payments."
msgstr ""
"Controla si el indicador de 'prueba' se envía a la API de ViaBill. "
"Utilice 'Prueba' mientras desarrolla o prueba (incluso cuando Odoo "
"esté en estado Habilitado/Producción). Cambie a 'Producción/En vivo' "
"solo cuando esté listo para procesar pagos reales."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_transaction_type
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid "Transaction Type"
msgstr "Tipo de transacción"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_transaction_type__authorize
msgid "Authorize Only"
msgstr "Solo autorizar"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_transaction_type__authorize_capture
msgid "Authorize and Capture"
msgstr "Autorizar y capturar"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_transaction_type
msgid ""
"Controls whether payments are only authorized (requiring manual "
"capture later) or automatically captured when ViaBill confirms the "
"payment."
msgstr ""
"Controla si los pagos solo se autorizan (lo que requiere captura "
"manual más adelante) o se capturan automáticamente cuando ViaBill "
"confirma el pago."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_product
msgid "Show PriceTag on Product Page"
msgstr "Mostrar PriceTag en la página del producto"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_product
msgid ""
"Display the ViaBill PriceTag instalment widget below the price on "
"product pages."
msgstr ""
"Muestra el widget de pago a plazos ViaBill PriceTag debajo del precio "
"en las páginas de producto."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_cart
msgid "Show PriceTag on Cart Page"
msgstr "Mostrar PriceTag en la página del carrito"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_cart
msgid ""
"Display the ViaBill PriceTag instalment widget below the total on the "
"cart page."
msgstr ""
"Muestra el widget de pago a plazos ViaBill PriceTag debajo del total "
"en la página del carrito."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_checkout
msgid "Show PriceTag on Checkout Page"
msgstr "Mostrar PriceTag en la página de pago"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_checkout
msgid ""
"Display the ViaBill PriceTag instalment widget below the total on the "
"checkout / payment page."
msgstr ""
"Muestra el widget de pago a plazos ViaBill PriceTag debajo del total "
"en la página de pago."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_country
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid "PriceTag Country"
msgstr "País de PriceTag"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_country__
msgid "Auto-detect (use shop's country)"
msgstr "Detección automática (usar el país de la tienda)"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_country__dk
msgid "Denmark"
msgstr "Dinamarca"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_country__es
msgid "Spain"
msgstr "España"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_country__us
msgid "United States"
msgstr "Estados Unidos"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_country__no
msgid "Norway"
msgstr "Noruega"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_country
msgid ""
"The country code sent to the ViaBill PriceTag widget. 'Auto-detect' "
"uses the shop company's country. Override this if the auto-detected "
"country is incorrect."
msgstr ""
"El código de país que se envía al widget ViaBill PriceTag. 'Detección "
"automática' usa el país de la empresa de la tienda. Cámbielo si el "
"país detectado no es correcto."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_language
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid "PriceTag Language"
msgstr "Idioma de PriceTag"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_language__
msgid "Auto-detect (use browser language)"
msgstr "Detección automática (usar el idioma del navegador)"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_language__en
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_legal_note_language__en
msgid "English"
msgstr "Inglés"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_language__es
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_legal_note_language__es
msgid "Spanish"
msgstr "Español"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_language__da
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_legal_note_language__da
msgid "Danish"
msgstr "Danés"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_language
msgid ""
"The language code sent to the ViaBill PriceTag widget. 'Auto-detect' "
"uses the current Odoo frontend language. Override this to force a "
"specific language for the widget."
msgstr ""
"El código de idioma que se envía al widget ViaBill PriceTag. "
"'Detección automática' usa el idioma actual del sitio web de Odoo. "
"Cámbielo para forzar un idioma concreto en el widget."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_custom_css
msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "CSS personalizado"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_custom_css
msgid ""
"Optional CSS rules injected into every frontend page when PriceTags "
"are active. Use this to adjust the placement and alignment of the "
"ViaBill PriceTag widget, e.g.: .viabill-pricetag { margin-top: 8px; "
"text-align: center; }"
msgstr ""
"Reglas CSS opcionales que se insertan en todas las páginas del sitio "
"web cuando PriceTag está activo. Úselas para ajustar la posición y la "
"alineación del widget ViaBill PriceTag, por ejemplo: .viabill-pricetag "
"{ margin-top: 8px; text-align: center; }"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_custom_js
msgid "Custom JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript personalizado"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_custom_js
msgid ""
"Optional JavaScript injected into every frontend page when PriceTags "
"are active. Runs after the ViaBill PriceTag script has been loaded. "
"Use this for advanced customisation of the widget behaviour."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript opcional que se inserta en todas las páginas del sitio web "
"cuando PriceTag está activo. Se ejecuta después de cargar el script de "
"ViaBill PriceTag. Úselo para personalizar en detalle el comportamiento "
"del widget."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_product_selector
msgid "PriceTag Product Selector"
msgstr "Selector de producto de PriceTag"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_product_selector
msgid ""
"CSS selector used by the ViaBill PriceTag widget to read the current "
"product price on product pages. Default: .oe_price"
msgstr ""
"Selector CSS utilizado por el widget ViaBill PriceTag para leer el "
"precio actual del producto en las páginas del producto. "
"Predeterminado: .oe_price"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_cart_selector
msgid "PriceTag Cart Selector"
msgstr "Selector de carrito de PriceTag"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_cart_selector
msgid ""
"CSS selector used by the ViaBill PriceTag widget to read the order "
"total on the cart page. Default: strong.monetary_field"
msgstr ""
"Selector CSS utilizado por el widget ViaBill PriceTag para leer el "
"total del pedido en la página del carrito. Valor predeterminado: "
"strong.monetary_field"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_checkout_selector
msgid "PriceTag Checkout Selector"
msgstr "Selector de pago de PriceTag"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_checkout_selector
msgid ""
"CSS selector used by the ViaBill PriceTag widget to read the order "
"total on the checkout / payment page. Default: strong.monetary_field"
msgstr ""
"Selector de CSS utilizado por el widget ViaBill PriceTag para leer el "
"total del pedido en la página de pago/compra. Valor predeterminado: "
"strong.monetary_field"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_authorize
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid "Order State after Authorize"
msgstr "Estado del pedido después de autorizar"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_authorize__pending
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_capture__pending
msgid "Pending Payment"
msgstr "Pago pendiente"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_authorize__sale
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_capture__sale
msgid "Sales Order / Confirmed"
msgstr "Orden de venta / Confirmada"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_authorize__done
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_capture__done
msgid "Locked"
msgstr "Bloqueado"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_authorize__draft
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:payment_viabill.selection__payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_capture__draft
msgid "Quotation"
msgstr "Cotización"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_authorize
msgid ""
"The sale order state to set after a successful ViaBill payment "
"authorization (when Transaction Type is 'Authorize Only'). Default: "
"Sales Order / Confirmed."
msgstr ""
"El estado del pedido de venta que se establece tras una autorización "
"correcta del pago de ViaBill (cuando el Tipo de transacción es 'Solo "
"autorizar'). Predeterminado: Orden de venta / Confirmada."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid "Order State after Capture"
msgstr "Estado del pedido después de la captura"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_order_state_after_capture
msgid ""
"The sale order state to set after a successful ViaBill payment capture "
"(when Transaction Type is 'Authorize and Capture'). Default: Sales "
"Order / Confirmed."
msgstr ""
"El estado del pedido de venta que se establece tras una captura "
"correcta del pago de ViaBill (cuando el Tipo de transacción es "
"'Autorizar y capturar'). Predeterminado: Orden de venta / Confirmada."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_enable_debug
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form_viabill_debug
msgid "Enable Debug"
msgstr "Habilitar depuración"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_enable_debug
msgid ""
"When enabled, detailed ViaBill API request/response information is "
"stored in the Debug Log below. Disable in production to avoid storing "
"sensitive data. The log is capped at 50 entries."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, la información detallada de "
"solicitud/respuesta de la API de ViaBill se almacena en el registro de "
"depuración a continuación. Deshabilítelo en producción para evitar "
"almacenar datos confidenciales. El registro tiene un límite de 50 "
"entradas."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_debug_log
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form_viabill_debug
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Registro de depuración"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_debug_log
msgid ""
"Recent ViaBill API debug messages (last 50 entries). Cleared "
"automatically when it exceeds 50 entries."
msgstr ""
"Mensajes de depuración recientes de la API de ViaBill (últimas 50 "
"entradas). Se borra automáticamente cuando supera las 50 entradas."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid "No ViaBill account credentials yet?"
msgstr "¿Aún no tiene las credenciales de su cuenta ViaBill?"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid ""
"Fill in the ViaBill online signup form to get your API key, secret key "
"and PriceTag script."
msgstr ""
"Complete el formulario de registro en línea de ViaBill para obtener su "
"clave API, su clave secreta y su script de PriceTag."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid "Go to the ViaBill signup form"
msgstr "Ir al formulario de registro de ViaBill"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_api_key
msgid ""
"The API key for your ViaBill merchant account. You can find this value "
"in your ViaBill merchant account."
msgstr ""
"La clave API de su cuenta de comercio de ViaBill. Encontrará este "
"valor en su cuenta de comercio de ViaBill."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_secret_key
msgid ""
"The secret key for your ViaBill merchant account, used to sign API "
"requests. You can find this value in your ViaBill merchant account."
msgstr ""
"La clave secreta de su cuenta de comercio de ViaBill, que se utiliza "
"para firmar las solicitudes a la API. Encontrará este valor en su "
"cuenta de comercio de ViaBill."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_pricetag_script
msgid ""
"The ViaBill PriceTag script snippet from your ViaBill merchant "
"account. Paste the full <script>…</script> HTML as provided by ViaBill "
"(raw inline JavaScript without the tags is also accepted). This script "
"is injected into every frontend page to enable the PriceTag widget."
msgstr ""
"El script de ViaBill PriceTag de su cuenta de comercio de ViaBill. "
"Pegue el HTML <script>…</script> completo tal como lo proporciona "
"ViaBill (también se acepta JavaScript en línea sin las etiquetas). "
"Este script se inserta en todas las páginas del sitio web para activar "
"el widget PriceTag."

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_viabill.field_payment_provider__viabill_credentials_missing
msgid "ViaBill Credentials Missing"
msgstr "Faltan las credenciales de ViaBill"

#. module: payment_viabill
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_viabill.payment_provider_form
msgid ""
"<strong>ViaBill Account Credentials.</strong> Enter your ViaBill API "
"Key, Secret Key and PriceTag Script in the Credentials section below. "
"You can find these values in your ViaBill merchant account. All three "
"values are required for the payment gateway and the PriceTags to work."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Credenciales de la cuenta de ViaBill.</strong> Introduzca su "
"clave API, su clave secreta y su script de PriceTag de ViaBill en la "
"sección Credenciales de abajo. Encontrará estos valores en su cuenta "
"de comercio de ViaBill. Los tres valores son necesarios para que "
"funcionen la pasarela de pago y PriceTag."

#. module: payment_viabill
